sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Buyer
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant LS as Logistics Service
    participant WS as Wallet Service
    actor C as Courier

    B->>OS: POST /orders (paymentMethod: COD)
    OS->>OS: CODEligibilityEngine.checkEligibility()
    OS->>WS: CODCommitmentService.secureCommitment(5%)
    WS-->>OS: holdId (Reserved Funds)
    OS->>OS: Save Order (status: Pending, holdId)
    OS-->>B: 201 Created (Pending Confirmation)

    Note over OS, LS: Order Processed & Handed to Logistics

    C->>LS: POST /cod/:deliveryId/otp
    LS->>LS: CODDeliverySaga.start()
    LS->>OS: Get Delivery Context (Buyer/Seller IDs)
    LS->>LS: Generate & Send OTP
    LS-->>C: 200 OK (OTP Sent)

    C->>B: At Delivery Point (Request OTP)
    B-->>C: Provides OTP

    C->>LS: POST /cod/:deliveryId/verify (OTP + GPS)
    LS->>LS: verify_cod_delivery step
    LS->>LS: Proximity & OTP Check
    LS->>LS: complete_cod_delivery step
    LS-->>C: 200 OK (Verification Success)

    LS->>WS: Trigger CODSettlementSaga (holdId, amount)
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note right of WS: CODSettlementSaga Flow
        WS->>WS: WaitForDisputeWindow (24h)
        WS->>WS: ProcessCODCommitment (Release Hold)
        WS->>WS: PayoutSellerAndCourier
        WS->>OS: Event: Settlement.Completed
    end

    OS->>OS: Update Order status: Settled
